        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 18SBM, 18 Inch Modern Surface Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18\" modern door bolts made of heavy duty solid brass and is available in 8 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 18 inch modern surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-18SBM-size.gif?v=1704354499\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 18SBM 18 Inch Modern Surface Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-modern-surface-bolt-deltana-6sbm\"><b> 6\" Modern Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-modern-surface-bolt-deltana-8sbm\"><b>8\" Modern Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-modern-surface-bolt-deltana-12sbm\"><b>12\" Modern Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-modern-surface-bolt-deltana-24sbm\"><b>24\" Modern Surface Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 18SBM 18 Inch Modern Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width of Guides: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-5/16\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Rod Resistance: 109 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Strikes: Includes 3 Different Strike Plates</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/18SBM.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 18SBM 18\" Modern Surface Bolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will 